<title>Frequently Asked Questions - Harris Thermal</title>
<meta name="description" content="Answers on ASME-certified fabrication, heat exchanger design standards, materials, maintenance best practices, bolt torque values, and repair services.">
<link rel="icon" href="/sites/harristhermal/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/cropped-favicon-32x32.png" sizes="32x32">
<link rel="icon" href="/sites/harristhermal/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/cropped-favicon-192x192.png" sizes="192x192">
