      <span class="px-eyebrow">Resources · FAQs</span>
      <h1>Your questions, <em>answered by engineers.</em></h1>
      <p class="lead">With over 140 years of experience, we’ve compiled answers to the questions engineers, plant operators, and EPCs ask most — covering design capabilities, materials, certifications, machining, and maintenance best practices.</p>
      <div class="px-ctas">
        <a class="px-btn px-btn-primary" href="/get-a-quote/">Get a Quote</a>
